{"page":110,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"102","words":[{"text":"102","x":235,"y":134,"width":71,"height":38}]},{"text":"CHAPTER02 • 애플리케이션 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER02","x":624,"y":138,"width":172,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":830,"y":144,"width":11,"height":13},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":874,"y":137,"width":158,"height":30},{"text":"계층","x":1045,"y":136,"width":51,"height":31}]},{"text":"주면, 기관(회사나 대학)은 지주 대역폭을 개선할 필요가 없게 되이 비핑가% 줄일 수 9』","words":[{"text":"주면,","x":598,"y":270,"width":78,"height":38},{"text":"기관(회사나","x":693,"y":268,"width":183,"height":42},{"text":"대학)은","x":890,"y":267,"width":114,"height":40},{"text":"지주","x":1017,"y":268,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"대역폭을","x":1099,"y":267,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"개선할","x":1247,"y":268,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"필요가","x":1360,"y":268,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"없게","x":1477,"y":270,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"되이","x":1558,"y":271,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"비핑가%","x":1642,"y":272,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"줄일","x":1757,"y":276,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1835,"y":282,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"9』","x":1879,"y":298,"width":20,"height":41}]},{"text":"다. 더욱이 웹 개시는 인터넷 전체의 웹 트래픽을 실질적으로 줄임으로:써 모든 에꾸","words":[{"text":"다.","x":598,"y":329,"width":41,"height":39},{"text":"더욱이","x":658,"y":330,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"웹","x":774,"y":330,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"개시는","x":822,"y":329,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"인터넷","x":938,"y":328,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"전체의","x":1054,"y":329,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"웹","x":1167,"y":328,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"트래픽을","x":1212,"y":329,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"실질적으로","x":1363,"y":329,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"줄임으로:써","x":1546,"y":332,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":1732,"y":336,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"에꾸","x":1813,"y":339,"width":77,"height":45}]},{"text":"게이션을 위한 성능을 개선한다.","words":[{"text":"게이션을","x":598,"y":391,"width":